{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:47:692","content":{"id":692,"title":"合并 K 个升序链表","content":[{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"7d293692-a7cd-4778-bc69-794a62a60bab","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"题目描述"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a2dbb799-dc20-4bb5-9083-82e10bb010db","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"给你一个链表数组，每个链表都已经按升序排列。请你将所有链表合并到一个升序链表中，返回合并后的链表。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"26e5060e-8177-4343-bad9-facf3144ba7f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例1："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"55774256-cdad-4f05-99b3-d13b1a938090","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"84ddd911-1c5b-449d-a764-433516951708","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"输入：lists = [[1,4,5],[1,3,4],[2,6]]\n输出：[1,1,2,3,4,4,5,6]\n解释：链表数组如下：\n[\n  1->4->5,\n  1->3->4,\n  2->6\n]\n将它们合并到一个有序链表中得到。\n1->1->2->3->4->4->5->6","collabId":"488d17eb-c567-416e-ad25-c5a17e9545dc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"674939e6-f96e-4e75-8cf1-b85572fdbd30","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例2："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"0b8533fd-0c4e-43eb-a150-251d4595e3bb","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"1ef60ca5-bb73-4cc9-87d1-0864e308abdc","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"输入：lists = []\n输出：[]","collabId":"dca12803-48cf-4d11-b619-76f7f7db387f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"24597386-2d04-4d0f-8649-b343d74b9786","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解题思路"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cfbf1abe-78cf-4b3b-a66d-27d1a74bebdc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我一开始的解题思路就是将两个链表一一合并，思路如下："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"db2fa933-aaaa-4703-a515-fd2ff876c848","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"253b85af-f47b-4f99-a8f0-e2ea97f3330d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"86fc828b-03a4-4437-aff3-f3cafc07d505","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"list1 + list2 -> list"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"de81648f-86c2-4570-a38a-a8308a40ecd6","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cca78453-cebf-4865-bc41-2a7b76012df2","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"list3 + list -> list"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"af938487-303b-4ce0-93bc-6dca2a4bfbe3","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3dec80dc-9236-4d40-8901-cd511ccc7739","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"list4 + list -> list"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"59914a8e-adc3-45c0-93e6-33bd0f4c0684","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2d0651c7-9b47-4fac-bcd2-d88cdb0eccbe","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"..."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6bff505d-4661-4db1-b6de-3733972e8b1a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以第一版的代码如下"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"c58fbe87-bece-4f12-b64e-81e824a22b40","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"c043b681-b0ba-458f-b00f-38c19a487f0f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"public ListNode mergeKLists(ListNode[] lists) {\n    ListNode root = null;\n    if (lists.length == 0) {\n        return root;\n    }\n    root = Arrays.stream(lists).reduce(null, this::mergeTwoList);\n    return root;\n}\n\n// 合并两个链表\nprivate ListNode mergeTwoList(ListNode l1, ListNode l2) {\n    if (l1 == null) {\n        return l2;\n    }\n    if (l2 == null) {\n        return l1;\n    }\n    ListNode p1 = l1;\n    ListNode p2 = l2;\n    ListNode dummyNode = new ListNode(0);\n    ListNode cuerNode = dummyNode;\n    while (p1 != null && p2 != null) {\n        if (p1.val <= p2.val) {\n            cuerNode.next = p1;\n            cuerNode = cuerNode.next;\n            p1 = p1.next;\n        } else {\n            cuerNode.next = p2;\n            cuerNode = cuerNode.next;\n            p2 = p2.next;\n        }\n    }\n    if (p1 == null) {\n        cuerNode.next = p2;\n    } else {\n        cuerNode.next = p1;\n    }\n    return dummyNode.next;\n}","collabId":"2249336b-35ba-4a99-83de-476cd57ac4ef","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d117469f-8a13-46e5-905d-54bbe949cad5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"然后一提交，发现只超过了 24% 的人"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_dcb0d4f7-5b4c-4c54-8ef6-cc2d2eca723c.webp","uuid":"6e2643e6-1869-40b2-bddd-4d3e70bc5e55","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_dcb0d4f7-5b4c-4c54-8ef6-cc2d2eca723c.webp","width":720,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"b761f4dc-0890-4edc-9016-834ff915c810","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cb318ede-a96d-4183-9f0e-ea1cfe1df9f6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"说明肯定有更快的算法，我便去找题解，在题解中发现发现使用分治的思路可以更快的得到排序好的数组。由于老弟我归并排序已经写得炉火纯青了，很快得到了第二版的代码"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"0c2ca5c1-4cfd-4974-9fcb-ba0765238803","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"1580690b-e5e3-40ff-9081-c23c0bca969f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"public ListNode mergeKLists(ListNode[] lists) {\n    if (lists.length == 0) {\n        return null;\n    }\n    return mergeKLists(lists, 0 , lists.length - 1);\n}\nprivate ListNode mergeKLists(ListNode[] lists, int left, int right) {\n    if (left == right) {\n        return lists[left];\n    }\n    ListNode leftList = null;\n    ListNode rightList = null;\n    int mid = left + (right - left) / 2;\n    leftList = mergeKLists(lists, left, mid);\n    rightList = mergeKLists(lists, mid + 1, right);\n    return mergeTwoList(leftList, rightList);\n}\n\n// 合并两个链表的代码同上，这里便不列出","collabId":"4344a571-4c41-4274-ada6-b770a368a972","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6d69c03f-4a58-4c39-ab8a-d1ec927f8695","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"再次提交"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_c42b96ae-44da-40df-98d5-39c7cd4c11c0.webp","uuid":"f54ba585-3608-45c2-9089-14e06ed572bd","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_c42b96ae-44da-40df-98d5-39c7cd4c11c0.webp","width":720,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"4fc94e92-cda5-47df-9ea8-0ea69e76f3a1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c5bc4f19-7ed4-4a17-a30a-88ad6ed4fe3d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"已经打败 87% 的人了，时间从 120ms 降到了 2ms，再次感受到了算法的魅力。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"09e8c3f0-4c97-4a9a-9106-335f3dd1499d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在最后我稍微分析归并的方法为什么比一个个合并较快，从合并的次数看，一个个合并需要合并 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"n - 1","collabId":"61fad17d-6218-4401-a070-6002bb85be52","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"n - 1"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 次，而归并排序需要合并"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\dfrac{n}{2} + \\dfrac{n}{4} + \\dfrac{n}{8} + \\cdots + 1","collabId":"3fe25520-8318-47fc-b762-900df60306e5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ac6196ee-9d24-456f-9371-b6da4f3c7966","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为了方便计算，不妨假设 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"n = 2^i","collabId":"01e3589b-bbd6-431e-8003-5b6ceb9e3c36","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"n = 2^i"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，即 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"n","collabId":"d419fb91-80b0-43ab-87f3-a4cea50aefdc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"n"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"2","collabId":"0ebaa55d-5645-490b-91aa-73ea8ed9b439","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的整数次幂，则上式可以改为"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\sum_{i = 1}^{\\log_2 n} \\frac{n}{2^i} \\approx n - 1","collabId":"fc090b01-6792-4023-a6b7-7a137da73790","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b3b48467-e600-4f69-bc88-fb0a9fa398aa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以从合并的次数上看，几乎是相当的。但是注意到一一合并得到的链表越来越长"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"b5e50593-79f5-4b69-989a-ce84c70f0eac","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e1db30ba-54ca-4604-a0f3-5f31a3e9bc90","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"aa01b8c4-eafc-4b96-9556-c7024ac5839c","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"list + listi -> list"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"ecf1af47-394f-423f-a4e5-6bf3229fcf8f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"98aae559-73ca-408d-8473-3e2499748f7b","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"list + list(i + 1) -> list"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"13062746-0550-47cb-aa1c-d254315198a5","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d195654c-41f4-4b2e-8aa6-b6bf1fc04fa1","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"..."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"27a73703-6bed-42d4-b29d-df797061dcf2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"链表 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"list"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 越来越长，合并需要的时间就越多。但是对于归并合并，它先将链表数组划分为两个一组然后合并，这两个一组的链表都是较短的，所需合并的速度较快。所以虽然他们合并的次数相差不大，但是归并合并的链表较一一合并短很多，所以便会较快。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"223ccf96-aa83-4308-abe8-29f4947a89a8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"fd23438a-9fbc-4170-8161-e71b894a1848","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"25d90252-d230-48ce-b829-2cdea60bb5cd","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"014ccd5f-d235-40f5-b802-dd2b7a40c189","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://leetcode-cn.com/problems/merge-k-sorted-lists/","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"d23fbdef-df51-4e32-9cd7-072a8553e583","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"合并K个升序链表"}]}]}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"LeetCode","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:718","type":"doc","id":718}},{"label":"链表"},{"label":"合并 K 个升序链表","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:692","type":"doc","id":692}}],"prevPage":{"title":"旋转链表","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:706","type":"doc","id":706}},"nextPage":{"title":"不同的二叉搜索树","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:677","type":"doc","id":677}},"createTime":1728999779645,"updateTime":1775928767125,"projectId":47},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1775928767125}}